  "note": "Issued by scripts/migrate_action_ball_solver_pin_to_semantic_surface.py. Its three gates ran and passed at this checkout: 198 covered symbols compared between the revision the v2 pin was minted from and this one, only two moved and both belong to the declaration half of the pin itself, and the three question-naming functions are byte-identical.",
