 },
 "plain_language": "The 2026-08-06 N=1 lineage was sealed against solver profile v2, whose pin was a whole-file SHA map over the solver sources. The runtime now computes a v3 pin over a per-symbol semantic surface, so every boot died on a solver profile SHA mismatch. This ledger records the one-for-one re-signing: which artifact replaced which, what changed inside each one, and the measurement that says the question was not re-drawn.",
